{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-17","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例与整数","englishTitle":"If a number by multiplying two numbers make certain numbers, the numbers so produced will have the same ratio as the numbers multiplied.","book":7,"number":17,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.17","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.17/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":17,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-17@raw-30014af609d7fb79","contentId":"euclid-7-17","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"30014af609d7fb79aeb61cf3ece7e4da6c4f4bb34ba6986b7b63d5aaabcaebe8","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-17.statement","euclid-7-17.construction.1","euclid-7-17.proof.1","euclid-7-17.proof.2","euclid-7-17.proof.3","euclid-7-17.proof.4","euclid-7-17.conclusion","euclid-7-17.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-17.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-17","revisionId":"euclid-7-17@raw-30014af609d7fb79","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"948790d3c6ba4be03d64068ccb54d5ae0a097a43e09cabb2c5da31e4cb573450","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a number by multiplying two numbers make certain numbers, the numbers so produced will have the same ratio as the numbers multiplied."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果数字乘以两个数字得出一定数字,那么延长的数字将具有与数字乘以相同的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-17.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-17","revisionId":"euclid-7-17@raw-30014af609d7fb79","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"35089aa5229eaa1dd4bd5a0ff1cb5a80ace3e8af091989a649adae652b76d6ee","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the number A by multiplying the two numbers B, C make D, E; I say that, as B is to C, so is D to E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A乘以2个数字B,C乘以D,E;我说,B对C的比等于D对E的比；B 与 C 之比等于 D 与 E 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-17.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-17","revisionId":"euclid-7-17@raw-30014af609d7fb79","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"54ca230a26fc4b555640059f5626d20e19ef771f4eebbee8cfd9f0c3a0a245d2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A by multiplying B has made D, therefore B measures D according to the units in A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,自A乘以B后,D,因此,根据A的单位,B 整除 D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-17.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-17","revisionId":"euclid-7-17@raw-30014af609d7fb79","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4bab3fe520527e2e8e5dd61fd975c34941422b9549eaf6e65452005307a858c0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the unit F also measures the number A according to the units in it; therefore the unit F measures the number A the same number of times that B measures D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但根据单位,单位,F 和A,整除。 因此,单位,F,整除,A,F乘以B,整除,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-17.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-17","revisionId":"euclid-7-17@raw-30014af609d7fb79","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d22737110d8f34dcfe4ef22124715c78b1a03de7eb56b7d8c1b783c3cda87784","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as the unit F is to the number A, so is B to D. [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,单位 F与A的比等于B与D的比。 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-17.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-17","revisionId":"euclid-7-17@raw-30014af609d7fb79","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e3c898425c3bde21428b039b6430690717b0863fb7d866cf371475e767943f65","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason, as the unit F is to the number A, so also is C to E; therefore also, as B is to D, so is C to E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,单位 F是A,C至E也是C;因此,B至D的比等于C至E的比；B 与 D 之比等于 C 与 E 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-17.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-17","revisionId":"euclid-7-17@raw-30014af609d7fb79","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c0e47a66f2a9739f5f9dde8fb3910a25b43873120781ada4b760ff5e67a9b24a","citations":["euclid-7-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, alternately, as B is to C, so is D to E. [[VII. 13](/principles/euclid-7-13)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,B对C的比则相当于D对E的比；B 与 C 之比等于 D 与 E 之比。 [[VII. 13](/principles/euclid-7-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-17.source","contentId":"euclid-7-17","revisionId":"euclid-7-17@raw-30014af609d7fb79","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"67cbc5f